<!-- What RosterWise Analyzes -->
<section class="product-section product-section--navy">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What RosterWise analyzes &mdash; at every program.</h2>
    <p>RosterWise goes beyond school lists. It applies <a href="/roster-intelligence/" style="color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600;">roster intelligence</a> &mdash; systematic analysis of who is actually on each team &mdash; to help families understand where their athlete fits, in every sport we cover.</p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Position Depth &amp; Class-Year Gaps</h3>
        <p>See who plays your athlete&rsquo;s position at every program, what class year they are, and when roster spots are opening. Graduating seniors create real opportunity &mdash; RosterWise surfaces it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Height &amp; Physical Profile by Position</h3>
        <p>How does each program build by position? See average heights and size profiles so you know where your athlete&rsquo;s physical profile aligns with the players already on the roster.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Geographic Recruiting Patterns</h3>
        <p>What states, regions, and countries does each program recruit from? Some programs recruit nationally; others draw heavily from specific regions. See the geographic patterns behind every roster.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Pathway &amp; Club Analysis</h3>
        <p>What clubs, academies, and high schools did current players come from? Pathway data helps you understand which development pipelines each program draws from &mdash; and whether your athlete&rsquo;s background aligns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Transfer Portal Activity</h3>
        <p>Does this program build primarily through high-school recruiting or through the transfer portal? Understanding a program&rsquo;s transfer patterns tells you how it fills roster spots &mdash; and what that means for a high-school recruit&rsquo;s path.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>International Composition</h3>
        <p>What portion of the roster is domestic vs. international, and what countries are represented? International recruiting varies dramatically by division and conference &mdash; this analysis helps you understand the competitive landscape at each program.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Coach Tenure &amp; Program Direction</h3>
        <p>How long has the head coach been building this program? Coaching stability tells you something about program culture and direction. RosterWise includes coach tenure data for every program where available.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Academic Fit &amp; School Profile</h3>
        <p>It&rsquo;s not just athletics. See school size, academic strength, graduation rates, and campus setting for every program. Find schools where your athlete fits in the classroom, not just on the field.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
